{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Granny Smith has \\$63. Elberta has \\$2 more than Anjou and Anjou has one-third as much as Granny Smith. How many dollars does Elberta have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a6d511e31a4be8d40978597758716996c82829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 19 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Anjou has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> the amount of money as Granny Smith and Granny Smith has &#36;<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, Anjou has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b425aafd7b94ffb4f0b98077111cf1583b686f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\times63=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" /> dollars. Elberta has &#36;<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than this, so she has &#36;<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d1302e73ece29d10218238af739577904f6f00a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<